<title>UK: All three Brent crudes cargoes kept - trade.</title>
<headline>All three Brent crudes cargoes kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>All three Brent crude cargoes which turned wet on Monday were kept, traders said.</p>
<p>Two of the three cargoes which load in the October 15-17 range were kept by British Petroleum and the third by Shell U.K.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 71 542 8978</p>
</text>
